@namespace MiddiFranchi.Web.Components.Shared
@using System.Globalization
@using MiddiFranchi.Application.Financial
@using MiddiFranchi.Domain.Portfolio
@using MiddiFranchi.Domain.Shared
@inject InvestmentAssetService AssetService

@if (Open)
{
    <div class="modal-backdrop" @onclick="CloseAsync">
        <div class="modal-card investment-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"
             aria-labelledby="investment-asset-dialog-title" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
            <div class="section-head">
                <div>
                    <h2 id="investment-asset-dialog-title">
                        @(Asset is null ? "Nuovo strumento" : "Modifica strumento")
                    </h2>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="icon-button" aria-label="Chiudi" disabled="@_saving" @onclick="CloseAsync">
                    <MfIcon Name="close" Size="18" />
                </button>
            </div>

            @if (_error is not null)
            {
                <p class="alert alert-error" role="alert">@_error</p>
            }

            <form class="form-grid investment-asset-form" @onsubmit="SaveAsync">
                <fieldset class="investment-form-section">
                    <legend><MfIcon Name="tag" Size="16" /> Identità e classificazione</legend>
                    <div class="investment-form-grid">
                        <label class="investment-form-wide">
                            <span>Nome *</span>
                            <input type="text" maxlength="200" required aria-required="true" @bind="_name" />
                        </label>

                        @if (LockAssetClass)
                        {
                            <label>
                                <span>Classe di attività</span>
                                <span class="status-chip neutral">@Format.AssetClassLabel(_assetClass)</span>
                            </label>
                        }
                        else
                        {
                            <label>
                                <span>Classe di attività *</span>
                                <select @bind="_assetClass" required aria-required="true">
                                    @foreach (var value in AvailableAssetClasses)
                                    {
                                        <option value="@value">@Format.AssetClassLabel(value)</option>
                                    }
                                </select>
                            </label>
                        }

                        <label>
                            <span>Unità di prezzo *</span>
                            <select @bind="_priceUnit" required aria-required="true">
                                @foreach (var value in Enum.GetValues<PriceUnit>())
                                {
                                    <option value="@value">@Format.PriceUnitLabel(value)</option>
                                }
                            </select>
                        </label>

                        <label>
                            <span>Sigla per il pricing</span>
                            <input type="text" maxlength="32" placeholder="Es. V3MA" @bind="_symbol" />
                        </label>

                        <label>
                            <span>Codice ISIN</span>
                            <input type="text" maxlength="12" placeholder="12 caratteri" @bind="_isin" />
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>

                @if (UsesNotionalValue || IsBond)
                {
                    <fieldset class="investment-form-section">
                        <legend><MfIcon Name="coin" Size="16" /> Dettagli finanziari</legend>
                        <div class="investment-form-grid">
                            @if (UsesNotionalValue)
                            {
                                <label>
                                    <span>Valore nominale per unità (€) *</span>
                                    <input type="number" inputmode="decimal" step="any" min="0" placeholder="1000,00"
                                           required aria-required="true" @bind="_notionalText" />
                                </label>
                            }

                            @if (IsBond)
                            {
                                <label>
                                    <span>Scadenza</span>
                                    <input type="date" @bind="_maturityDate" />
                                </label>
                                <label>
                                    <span>Rendimento annuo (%)</span>
                                    <input type="number" inputmode="decimal" step="any" min="0" max="100"
                                           placeholder="Es. 3,5" @bind="_couponRateText" />
                                </label>
                            }
                        </div>
                    </fieldset>
                }

                <fieldset class="investment-form-section">
                    <legend><MfIcon Name="link" Size="16" /> Riferimenti e note</legend>
                    <div class="investment-form-grid">
                        <label class="investment-form-wide">
                            <span>Link alla scheda dello strumento</span>
                            <input type="url" maxlength="500" placeholder="https://…" @bind="_referenceUrl" />
                        </label>

                        <label class="investment-form-wide">
                            <span>Nota breve</span>
                            <textarea rows="3" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Es. PAC mensile, commissioni, strategia…"
                                      @bind="_notes"></textarea>
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </fieldset>

                <div class="form-actions">
                    <button type="submit" class="primary-button" disabled="@_saving">
                        <MfIcon Name="@SaveIcon" Size="18" />
                        @(Asset is null ? "Crea strumento" : "Salva modifiche")
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" class="secondary-button" disabled="@_saving" @onclick="CloseAsync">
                        Annulla
                    </button>
                </div>
            </form>

            @if (Asset is not null && CanDelete)
            {
                <div class="settings-danger-zone investment-delete-zone">
                    @if (_deleteError is not null)
                    {
                        <p class="alert alert-error" role="alert">@_deleteError</p>
                    }
                    @if (_confirmingDelete)
                    {
                        <div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert">
                            <div>Eliminare definitivamente «@_name»? L'operazione non è reversibile.</div>
                            <div class="form-actions">
                                <button type="button" class="danger-button" disabled="@_deleting" @onclick="DeleteAsync">
                                    <MfIcon Name="trash" Size="16" /> Elimina definitivamente
                                </button>
                                <button type="button" class="secondary-button" disabled="@_deleting" @onclick="CancelDelete">
                                    Annulla
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    }
                    else
                    {
                        <button type="button" class="delete-button" disabled="@_saving" @onclick="StartDelete">
                            <MfIcon Name="trash" Size="16" /> Elimina strumento
                        </button>
                    }
                </div>
            }
        </div>
    </div>
}

@code {
    [Parameter] public bool Open { get; set; }

    [Parameter] public InvestmentAssetRow? Asset { get; set; }

    [Parameter] public bool CanDelete { get; set; }

    [Parameter] public AssetClass DefaultAssetClass { get; set; } = AssetClass.Equity;

    [Parameter] public bool LockAssetClass { get; set; }

    [Parameter] public EventCallback OnClose { get; set; }

    [Parameter] public EventCallback OnSaved { get; set; }

    [Parameter] public EventCallback OnDeleted { get; set; }

    private static readonly AssetClass[] AvailableAssetClasses =
    [
        AssetClass.Equity,
        AssetClass.Bond,
        AssetClass.MoneyMarket,
        AssetClass.Other,
    ];

    private bool _wasOpen;
    private bool _saving;
    private bool _deleting;
    private bool _confirmingDelete;
    private string? _error;
    private string? _deleteError;
    private string _name = "";
    private AssetClass _assetClass = AssetClass.Equity;
    private PriceUnit _priceUnit = PriceUnit.PerUnit;
    private string _symbol = "";
    private string _isin = "";
    private string _notionalText = "";
    private string _referenceUrl = "";
    private string _notes = "";
    private string _couponRateText = "";
    private DateOnly? _maturityDate;

    private string SaveIcon => Asset is null ? "plus" : "check";

    private bool IsBond => _assetClass == AssetClass.Bond;

    private bool UsesNotionalValue => _priceUnit == PriceUnit.PercentOfNominal;

    protected override void OnParametersSet()
    {
        if (!Open)
        {
            _wasOpen = false;
            return;
        }

        if (_wasOpen)
        {
            return;
        }

        _wasOpen = true;
        _saving = false;
        _deleting = false;
        _confirmingDelete = false;
        _error = null;
        _deleteError = null;

        _name = Asset?.Name ?? "";
        _assetClass = Asset?.AssetClass ?? DefaultAssetClass;
        _priceUnit = Asset?.PriceUnit ?? PriceUnit.PerUnit;
        _symbol = Asset?.Symbol ?? "";
        _isin = Asset?.Isin ?? "";
        _notionalText = Asset?.NotionalValue is { } notional
            ? notional.Amount.ToString(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)
            : "";
        _referenceUrl = Asset?.ReferenceUrl ?? "";
        _notes = Asset?.Notes ?? "";
        _couponRateText = Asset?.CouponRate is { } rate
            ? rate.ToString(CultureInfo.InvariantCulture)
            : "";
        _maturityDate = Asset?.MaturityDate;
    }

    private async Task SaveAsync()
    {
        if (_saving || _deleting)
        {
            return;
        }

        _error = null;

        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_name))
        {
            _error = "Il nome dello strumento è obbligatorio.";
            return;
        }

        Money? notional = null;
        if (UsesNotionalValue)
        {
            if (!TryParseDecimal(_notionalText, out var amount) || amount <= 0m)
            {
                _error = "Il valore nominale per unità deve essere positivo.";
                return;
            }

            notional = new Money(amount, Currency.Euro);
        }

        decimal? couponRate = null;
        if (IsBond && !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(_couponRateText))
        {
            if (!TryParseDecimal(_couponRateText, out var rate) || rate <= 0m || rate > 100m)
            {
                _error = "Il rendimento annuo deve essere maggiore di zero e non superiore a 100.";
                return;
            }

            couponRate = rate;
        }

        var maturityDate = IsBond ? _maturityDate : null;

        _saving = true;
        try
        {
            if (Asset is null)
            {
                await AssetService.CreateAsync(new NewInvestmentAsset(
                    _name,
                    _assetClass,
                    _priceUnit,
                    notional,
                    _symbol,
                    _isin,
                    _referenceUrl,
                    _notes,
                    maturityDate,
                    couponRate));
            }
            else
            {
                await AssetService.UpdateAsync(new UpdateInvestmentAssetRequest(
                    Asset.InstrumentId,
                    _name,
                    _assetClass,
                    _priceUnit,
                    notional,
                    _symbol,
                    _isin,
                    _referenceUrl,
                    _notes,
                    maturityDate,
                    couponRate));
            }

            await OnSaved.InvokeAsync();
            await OnClose.InvokeAsync();
        }
        catch (ArgumentException exception)
        {
            _error = exception.Message;
        }
        catch (InvalidOperationException exception)
        {
            _error = exception.Message;
        }
        catch (Exception)
        {
            _error = "Impossibile salvare lo strumento. Verificare la connessione al database e riprovare.";
        }
        finally
        {
            _saving = false;
        }
    }

    private void StartDelete()
    {
        _deleteError = null;
        _confirmingDelete = true;
    }

    private void CancelDelete()
    {
        _confirmingDelete = false;
        _deleteError = null;
    }

    private async Task DeleteAsync()
    {
        if (Asset is null || _deleting)
        {
            return;
        }

        _deleting = true;
        _deleteError = null;
        try
        {
            await AssetService.DeleteAsync(Asset.InstrumentId);
            await OnDeleted.InvokeAsync();
            await OnClose.InvokeAsync();
        }
        catch (InvalidOperationException exception)
        {
            _deleteError = exception.Message;
        }
        catch (Exception)
        {
            _deleteError = "Impossibile eliminare lo strumento. Verificare la connessione al database e riprovare.";
        }
        finally
        {
            _deleting = false;
        }
    }

    private async Task CloseAsync()
    {
        if (_saving || _deleting)
        {
            return;
        }

        await OnClose.InvokeAsync();
    }

    private static bool TryParseDecimal(string? text, out decimal value)
    {
        value = 0m;
        if (string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(text))
        {
            return false;
        }

        return decimal.TryParse(text, NumberStyles.Float, CultureInfo.InvariantCulture, out value)
            || decimal.TryParse(text, NumberStyles.Float, CultureInfo.GetCultureInfo("it-IT"), out value);
    }
}
